      children: ["Query strings are name-value pairs appended to a URL after a question mark, separated by ampersands. They emerged as part of the original HTTP specification as a mechanism for passing data to server-side scripts and programs. The format follows RFC 3986 URI specification, which defines the structure: ", _jsx(_components.code, {
